| Feature            | TCP                                       | UDP                    |
| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |
| Full form          | Transmission Control Protocol             | User Datagram Protocol |
| Connection         | Connection-oriented                       | Connectionless         |
| Reliability        | Reliable (acknowledgment, retransmission) | Unreliable             |
| Speed              | Slow                                      | Fast                   |
| Ordering           | Ordered delivery                          | No ordering guarantee  |
| Error checking     | Strong error control                      | Basic error check      |
| Flow control       | Yes                                       | No                     |
| Congestion control | Yes                                       | No                     |
| Header size        | Large (20 bytes)                          | Small (8 bytes)        |
